s: task for 001316 (done ~16:40), task for 600211 (mine, now)... and the task expects the re-research files for 600211 to exist. But they don't. \n\nHmm, actually wait. Let me look again at the git status output from earlier:\n- Modified: 001316 four base files (modified today)\n- Untracked: 001316 four -20260817 files\n- Untracked: 002415 -20260819 files (商业模式, 行业竞争, 风险评估) — 财务估值-20260819 not listed... but base 财务估值 modified Aug 21.\n\nFor 002415: files -20260819 exist for 商业模式, 行业竞争, 风险评估, but 财务估值-20260819... let me check. From the ls earlier:\n```\n-rw-r--r-- 1 17356 197609 23836 Aug 19 15:14 002415海康威视-商业模式-段永平视角-20260819.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 17356 197609 23956 Aug 20 13:46 002415海康威视-商业模式-段永平视角.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 17356 197609 30113 Aug 19 15:15 002415海康威视-行业竞争-芒格视角-20260819.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 17356 197609 36130 Aug 21 11:44 002415海康威视-行业竞争-芒格视角.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 17356 197609 23818 Aug 21 11:50 002415海康威视-财务估值-巴菲特视角.md  (no -20260819 suffix version!)\n-rw-r--r-- 1 17356 197609 24000 Aug 19 15:15 002415海康威视-风险评估-李录视角-20260819.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 17356 197609 28551 Aug 21 11:57 002415海康威视-风险评估-李录视角.md\n```\n\nSo the pattern: re-research writes NEW files with -YYYYMMDD suffix; then a later \"对齐重写\" task rewrites the BASE files (no suffix) to align with the dated files. That's exactly the workflow my memory note describes: \"同公司重跑时增量更新+日期后缀新文件\".\n\nSo for 600211 西藏药业, the expected state is:\n- reports/600211西藏药业-财务估值-巴菲特视角.md (maybe with -YYYYMMDD suffix version) ← re-research output\n- reports/600211西藏药业-行业竞争-芒格视角.md ← re-research output\n- reports/600211西藏药业-风险评估-李录视角.md ← re-research output\n- reports/600211西藏药业-商业模式-段永平视角.md ← OLD, to be rewritten by me\n\nBut NONE of these exist. The re-research of 西藏药业 has not been done (or its outputs are lost). Only:\n- reports/西藏药业_600211_财务估值_巴菲特视角.md (old naming, Aug 9)\n- 西藏药业_行业竞争_芒格视角.md in session dir (Aug 9)\n\nLet me check the sessions directory listing to see if there are recent session logs (maybe from earlier today) that mention this batch for 600211. The Grep for \"西藏药业\" in sessions returned nothing, but maybe the sessions are stored elsewhere. Let me list the sessions dir.",
