l, +25% mid). 巴菲特 used 15x中性 → 55元 (+39%).\n\nFor consistency (\"数据、估值、结论对齐其他三份新报告\"), and since the 段永平 business-model view of a 94%-margin, 27%+ ROE cash cow with 4% dividend would actually be POSITIVE on the business quality (he loves simple, high-ROE, high-FCF businesses), the honest 段永平 take: 商业模式本身是好生意（茅台式的印钞机），但单品独大+专利倒计时 让\"十年看不透\"，所以估值要打折。段永平会取中值: 中性情景 15x × 10.0亿(2026E) = 150亿 = 46.5元? Or use 巴菲特's 55 as the optimistic ceiling and 芒格's 48 as the reasonable floor → 内在价值区间 46-55, 中枢 ~50元 → vs 现价 38.99 (08-22) → +28%.\n\nHmm, I'm going back and forth. Let me settle on a defensible approach:\n\n段永平视角 numbers:\n- 内在价值中枢: 取中性 8% 增长 × 15x PE → 3.67×15 = 55元 (same as 巴菲特中性). But 段永平 discounts for 单品依赖+专利+竞品: 给 13x → 47.7元. Or use 概率加权: 乐观20%×88.5 + 中性55%×55 + 悲观25%×29.1 = 55.2 (巴菲特's number). 段永平 more conservative weights: 乐观15%/中性50%/悲观35% → 0.15×88.5+0.5×55+0.35×29.1 = 13.3+27.5+10.2 = 51.0元 → vs 38.99 → +31%. \n\nThat gives: 内在涨幅 +31%, 🟡, 建仓 44×0.85≈? Hmm. Let me simplify and be internally consistent:\n\n- 内在价值中枢 50元 (between 芒格 48 and 巴菲特 55, justified by 段永平's business-quality positive but single-product discount)\n- 现价基准: The other two reports use 39.56 (08-07/08-09). The current price is 38.99 (08-22). Which baseline to use? The task says align with the other reports — they use 39.56. But the rewrite should also be fresh-ish... The task instruction: \"数据、估值、结论对齐其他三份新报告\" — so use the same baseline as them: 39.56元. 内在涨幅 = 50/39.56-1 = +26.4% ≈ +26%. Hmm that lands right at 芒格's +25%. \n\nAlternatively pick 中枢 52元 (prob-weighted 51) → +31.5% ≈ +31~32%.\n\nUgh. OK let me think about what's cleanest for the system and most defensible:\n\nOption A (align tightly to 巴菲特, the only system-parsed view): +39%, 🟡, 44, 36. Justification: 商业模式质量顶级 (94%毛利/27%ROE/现金流>利润/60%分红), 段永平认可生意本身; 单品风险已在中性估值打折体现。→ Maximizes \"四视角一致\" with the canonical view. The 商业模式 view then agrees with 巴菲特 while noting 芒格 is more conservative. But 段永平 \"十年看不透\" would make him... hmm, honestly 段